text+=['These ratios use their own known cumulative denominators; the mean across samples is not maximum occupancy, a stall fraction or critical-path latency. Gauges/peaks are retained separately and never differenced.','', '## Memcpy initial-state policy: runtime-matched evidence','',table(['Program','Closed sources','HtoD calls before kernel','Bytes before kernel'],[[n,4,len(next(x for x in W if x['program']==n)['ordered_invocations']),next(x for x in W if x['program']==n)['copy_bytes']]for n in D]),'', 'Every closed raw explicitly prints the exact frozen `MemcpyHtoD` commands before `Processing kernel`; the ordered commands match current kernelslist bytes/SHA and the frozen binding. All eight effective option maps retain perf_sim_memcpy=1, L2 flush=0. The fixed Framework calls `perf_memcpy_to_gpu`; Core iterates32-byte addresses and reaches `force_l2_tag_update`/tag-array fill instead of ordinary timed DRAM requests. `CONSUMED_MEMCPY_SOURCE_EVIDENCE.json` carries exact file SHA/commit/line excerpts; its complete source SHA set was rechecked. This is runtime invocation evidence linked to fixed code, stronger than source-only conjecture. It does not quantify which addresses survived replacement to kernel launch or certify capture-time numeric input.','', 'GEMM has three1-MiB copies and its measured L2/DRAM counters confirm zero L2 misses/DRAM requests under this policy. 2DCONV has one64-MiB copy; this must not be interpreted as all64 MiB resident in10-MiB L2, and the measured nonzero DRAM traffic explicitly prevents such a claim. No cold-start or real-GPU generalization follows, and changing the warm-state policy would require a separately authorized experiment.','', '## Fixed source and evidence levels','', 'Atlas47a097aad4406893a07f8d230e1e0a850609bf39 maps the candidate GEMM source dad09cb0487845edc7524ded814c6cde9f0ef6a1 `GEMM/gemm.cu:124-138;141-173` (SHA1728a0f34c0ef150be6e4ba481f43298753fbcc814e402f853fc0c63a3c3dfbb) and 2DCONV `2DCONV/2DConvolution.cu:108-125;128-151` (SHA5e12047cbe8cc8a21658d15df602434ee70ebf0b873d45119974fb49da63a192). These establish conditional naive-GEMM recurrence/reuse and stencil neighbor overlap. They are fixed candidate source facts; source-to-capture ELF binding remains UNRESOLVED, and static address overlap is not a runtime hit/merge count. Atlas historical "body unresolved" text is not retroactively edited: the separate current full-body qualification now establishes the declared replay body scope only.','', 'Runtime facts use fixed Core9eedb3131937748f0492fa83aad37d3691118d70, Framework02775fd795cde5aae1480d81cee6eb481d0a08f4 and binary02a289360b42a573832698c978f21ad2125182a453067a35be60410f1eb8888d. CH/DH intended L1/Tag/PIB/service differences are fully preserved in each `CH_DH_deliberate_option_differences`. StageI original reference roles remain original; new CH remains STAGEII_AUTHORIZED_CH. No R2/IR/EP/PQPS performance result was substituted.','', '## Missing observations and latency limits','', '2DCONV DH P0/F128 strict `latency_counters` are empty, despite explicit nonzero DRAM reads: they remain MISSING, never0. Both end before500,000 core cycles; fixed stat-print/update ordering can leave num_mfs un-folded and suppress means. CH prints means (including MRQ41 cycles in both profiles), but this does not supply the missing DH window. GEMM also prints selected means with known sample/tail limitations; no means are summed, differenced, or called a complete L2->DRAM critical-path latency.','', 'No current counter proves time-resolved queue occupancy, credit occupancy, age of critical dependent loads, bank/row scheduling causality or cycle attribution to each retry reason. Useful read-only follow-up is controller issued read/write/activation distribution and complete typed counter reconciliation. A small approved observation experiment would be needed for request/credit occupancy histories and dependency-tagged service residence; none is started or registered here.','', '## Reproduction and source locator','', '`python3 analyze_controls.py GEMM`, `python3 analyze_controls.py 2DCONV`, then `python3 build_control_evidence.py` regenerate only this packet outputs from closed read-only sources; `python3 render_controls.py` regenerates this report. Each per-program `MATCHED_FOUR_SOURCE_DATA.json` records all four RESULT paths/SHA, UUID, raw gzip/uncompressed SHA, NATIVE_EXIT SHA, exact input, build/options, individual buckets and retry reasons. `INPUT_CONTRACT_PROJECTION.json` binds the canonical spec and full-body qualification to actual ROI. `RUNTIME_MEMCPY_AND_GEOMETRY_WITNESS.json` pins raw line positions and header geometry. `CPU_VALIDATION.json` records70 passing checks. Original source bytes, existing consumers and all active jobs remain untouched.','']
